src-tauri/.cache

# The Ascent (#00056) — updater signing keys. The private key is the
# security spine: lose it and no future build can ever update an installed
# balcony. It is escrowed by the investor (password manager + GitHub Actions
# secrets) and NEVER committed. The public key lives in tauri.conf.json under
# plugins.updater.pubkey — not as a loose file. RD-4.
*.key
*.key.pub
.tauri-keys/

# Chronicle transcripts safeguard — canonical path is ~/.zmuuzn-cockpit/
# (outside any repo); these entries fire if the chronicle base ever drifts
# inside the gadget's working tree.
.zmuuzn-cockpit/
.zmuuzn-cockpit-transcripts/
